---
title: Presse — Aeternus Verlag
description: "Presseinformationen des AETERNUS VERLAG: Rezensionsexemplare, Bildmaterial und Anfragen von Redaktionen, Buchhandel, Bibliotheken und Kulturinstitutionen."
layout: base.njk
lang: de
permalink: /presse/index.html
---

<main>
<!-- Presse — volle Fassung. Top-Padding 180px, damit die Überschrift den fixierten Header freigibt. -->
<section class="block" style="background-color: #161311; padding: 180px 0 100px; position: relative; border-top: 1px solid rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.15);">
  <div class="paper-grain" style="position:absolute;inset:0;opacity:.12;pointer-events:none;"></div>
  <div class="wrap container1">
    <div class="press-grid">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow" style="color: var(--gold); letter-spacing: 0.15em; font-size: 0.85rem; margin-bottom: 15px;">✦ {{ i18n["press.eyebrow"][lang] }}</p>
        <h1 class="title-xl" style="margin-top: 15px; font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 400;"><span class="gold-grad">{{ i18n["press.title"][lang] }}</span></h1>
        <div class="lede" style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.75; color: rgba(243, 231, 207, 0.8); margin-bottom: 35px;"><p>{{ i18n["press.body"][lang] | safe }}</p></div>
        <a href="mailto:kontakt@aeternus-verlag.de" class="btn-press">{{ i18n["press.button"][lang] }} <span style="margin-left: 6px;">→</span></a>
      </div>
      <div class="notes-box">
        <h3 style="font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 1.2rem; color: #f3e7cf; font-weight: 400; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 25px; letter-spacing: 0.02em; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.15); padding-bottom: 12px;">{% if lang == 'de' %}Pressehinweise{% else %}Press Notes{% endif %}</h3>
        <div>
          {% for note in i18n.pressNotes %}
            <div class="note-item"><span>{{ note[lang] }}</span></div>
          {% endfor %}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
</main>
